{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のblogはまあやが見たメンバーの癖とビックリしたことを少し書くね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でまず松村さゆり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんの癖は"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話すときとかに顔回りに手があります！(ひめたんもですw)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんに対してビックリしたこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯に向かって\n『送信しますか？ 』\nっていう画面が出たら\n『はい』\nっと声に出して言ってしまうんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて高山かずみさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんの癖"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『いやいやいや』が口癖\nいつも自分のお尻叩いてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の楽屋も隣の席に座って笑いあいましたw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリしたこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TVを見てて、拍手してるシーンがあったら自分も一緒に見ながら拍手しちゃうらしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドンドン行きましょう\n白石麻衣！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんの癖"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親指と人差し指を擦るのが癖\n緊張したときとかにするのかなぁ？ってまあやは発見した"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリしたこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋でまいやんの隣に座って話してたんだけど、わざと声大きくして話してきたりするとても変わってる人だと思った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいつも人を笑わせてる！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！関係ないけどまいやんまあやの絵めっちゃ誉めてくれるの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやとひなちまでまいやんの脚を押して痛い"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなるまで柔軟しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(撮影さゆりん)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、さゆりんとこの前\n初ケバブを食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔中に付けて頬張って食べました！笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"t