da/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんかっこ良かった！\n泣き顔も可愛いよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、スカイウォークをしてくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん  いくちゃん  かずみん...日村さんも凄い怖かったのに頑張っててカッコ良かった〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マカオタワー登ったときは\nもう地球まるごと見えてるんじゃないかと思うくらい高くて......ほんとヤバかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんお疲れさま......ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななつん卒業なんだね...おめでとう！って言わないとね...\n短い間だったけど沢山の思い出を一緒につくることが出来ました！\nこれからも夢に向かって頑張って\nまあやも頑張るから\np(^-^)q\n私達の事忘れないでね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は久しぶりのoffでひなちまと\n渋谷、原宿で遊びました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見かけて声かけてくださった方ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問に沢山の方が答えてくれてありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牡蠣が苦手な方もいましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国にはまだ食べた事ないし、聞いた事もない美味しい食べ物が沢山あるんだね〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！乃木坂でも行かせてもらったけど、\n小さい時に家族で２回位 北海道に行った事あって、その時に食べた蟹やウニや、イクラ等々凄く美味しいかったです(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業式を迎えた方へ\nおめでとうございますm(__)m\n新しい生活が始まるね♪\nドキドキや不安があると思うけど\n応援します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやも４月から高校生！\n一緒に頑張る！p(^-^)q"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタジオ初披露の『気づいたら片想い』どうでしたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/03/18/3991236/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}